<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon ups ENI, Elf.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon ups ENI, Elf.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>ENI and Elf Acquitaine were raised to &quot;hold&quot; and &quot;buy&quot; respectively at Salomon Brothers, a research note from analysts at the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Salomon said the two were undervalued following recent underperformance, offsetting concerns over the impact of further oil price weakness.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
